---
import { withBase } from '../config/url';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="footer-brand">GetPassLab</div>
      <p class="footer-desc">산업안전기사 합격을 위한 개념·공식·기출 학습 서비스. 핵심만 빠르게.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4>학습</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={withBase('/industrial-safety/written/')}>필기 과목</a></li>
        <li><a href={withBase('/industrial-safety/')}>산업안전기사</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4>서비스</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={withBase('/')}>홈</a></li>
        <li><a href={withBase('/terms/')}>이용약관</a></li>
        <li><a href={withBase('/privacy/')}>개인정보처리방침</a></li>
        <li><a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>문의</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <div>
      <span>© 2026 GetPassLab.</span>
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
